01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:46,000
Mixed Nuts is a 1994 American Christmas black comedy film directed by Nora Ephron, based on the
1982 French comedy film Le Père Noël est une ordure (Santa Claus is a Stinker).

11
01:11:08,000 --> 01:11:14,000
Co-written by Ephron and her sister Delia, the film features an ensemble cast which includes Steve Martin, Madeline Kahn, Rita
Wilson, Anthony LaPaglia, Garry Shandling, Rob Reiner, Juliette Lewis, Adam Sandler, and Liev Schreiber in his film debut.

12
01:17:36,000 --> 01:17:42,000
The film was released theatrically on December 21, 1994, and
was both a critical and commercial failure.

